 2> facing each other among broken concrete and drifting dust. <Subject 1> grips her silver sword low in a ready stance, while <Subject 2> holds her cyan-accented katana at her side. Both fighters step forward at the same moment and collide in the center of the frame. Their blades cross with a sharp metallic flash, sending a burst of blue-white sparks and fine dust outward. The camera remains stable but pushes in slowly as the impact point flares.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the shot cuts to a dynamic low-angle close-up. <Subject 1> spins her silver sword in a wide arc, her lavender hair sweeping across the frame. <Subject 2> ducks beneath the strike and sweeps her katana upward in a counter. The two blades trace crossing light trails, and a brief shockwave ripples through the dust. The camera arcs quickly around the fighters at low amplitude, emphasizing the speed of the exchange.\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a medium two-shot from the side. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> separate into mirrored defensive stances, blades raised and eyes locked. A final synchronized strike sends them apart in opposite directions, their clothing and hair flowing outward as the dust settles. The camera pulls back smoothly to reveal the ruined city skyline behind them, ending on a balanced, poised composition.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSharp metallic blade clashes, fast footwork impacts on broken concrete, whooshing air from rapid sword arcs, and low ambient wind through the ruined city.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA driving orchestral martial-arts score with fast strings, sharp percussion hits, and a low taiko pulse, building intensity across the three shots."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 14, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [448.7922668457031, 796.09375], "pos": [3465.9599609375, 0], "id": 18, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name fo